							<fig id="e00527">
								<figgroup>
									<image href="images/N_SP3i25_C00_003_IR.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
								</figgroup>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="2"/>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<p>The warning message will appear on the LCD display when hood is open.</p>
		<p>The chime will sound if you drive with the hood opened.</p>
